{"id":"8646fc576098d22e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-relative-K-turing.md","title":"Relative K Reducibility Implies Turing Reducibility","display":"thm-relative-K-turing — Relative K Reducibility Implies Turing Reducibility","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-relative-K-turing","aliases":["43-thm-relative-K-turing"],"display":"thm-relative-K-turing — Relative K Reducibility Implies Turing Reducibility","depends_on":["[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.7.8","source_printed_pages":"363–364","source_pdf_pages":"383–384","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-relative-K-turing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-relative-K-turing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-K-turing — Relative K Reducibility Implies Turing Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.7.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"363–364"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"383–384"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\to B\\le_T A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\to B\\le_T A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选择最小候选上界后，在无限多个长度全部候选停止；这些长度给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算的有界宽度树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是其有限多个路径之一，因而可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 计算。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.7.8；印刷页 363–364，PDF 页 383–384。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","